@startuml C1_Search_Operation_Plans_Process_View
title C1 – Search Operation Plans (Process View)

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
participant "Operation Plans UI" as UI
participant "TodoApi Gateway" as Gateway
participant "OEM Service" as OEM
participant "OEM Database" as Db

Operator -> UI : Enter filters (from/to, VVN)
Operator -> UI : Click "Filtrar"
UI -> Gateway : GET /api/oem/operation-plans?...
Gateway -> OEM : Forward GET with identity headers
OEM -> Db : SELECT plans WHERE date BETWEEN ...
Db --> OEM : Plan rows
OEM --> Gateway : 200 + JSON
Gateway --> UI : Plan list
UI --> Operator : Render table, update pagination

@enduml
